.
├── app/                    # Next.js App Router (routing, layouts, error boundaries)
│   ├── layout.tsx
│   ├── page.tsx            # imports screen from views/
│   ├── error.tsx
│   ├── not-found.tsx
│   └── globals.css
│
├── views/                  # FSD views — screen composition (maps to FSD "pages")
│   └── home/
│       └── home-view.tsx
│
├── widgets/                # Composite UI blocks (layouts, design-system primitives)
│   ├── layouts/            # add main-layout, dashboard-layout when needed
│   └── ui/
│       └── button/
│
├── features/               # User-facing features (auth, checkout, …)
│   └── auth/
│       └── model/
│           └── types.ts    # feature state types; entity types live in entities/
│
├── entities/               # Business entities
│   └── user/
│       └── model/
│           └── types.ts
│
├── shared/                 # Cross-cutting code (config, api clients, providers, utils)
│   ├── config/
│   │   └── env.ts
│   ├── hooks/
│   ├── lib/
│   ├── providers/
│   └── utils/
│
├── public/
├── Dockerfile
├── eslint.config.mjs       # includes eslint-plugin-import-fsd
└── next.config.ts          # standalone + security headers

Import rules (enforced by eslint-plugin-import-fsd)
-------------------------------------------------
app → views, widgets, features, entities, shared
views → widgets, features, entities, shared
widgets → features, entities, shared
features → entities, shared (not other feature slices)
entities → shared only

State management: not included — add under shared/lib/ and shared/providers/.
